      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The intense feeling that things should just stop is a powerful expression of overwhelming pain, but it does not mean that accepting it is the logical or best resolution. Your worth is inherent, regardless of your productivity or how you feel right now. Even when nothing seems fixable, there are people who can sit with the pain *with* you without trying to 'fix' you immediately. Please reach out to a crisis line because they are trained to listen to the depth of your despair without judgment.",
